    <td style="color:#223388; font-size:150%; vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:black; font-weight:600">NIST Atomic Spectra Database Lines Data</span><p>
      <u>N I</u>: 1309 Lines of Data Found<br />
<span style="font-size:larger; font-weight:bold"><i>Z</i> = 7, N isoelectronic sequence</span><span style="font-size=300%">&nbsp;</span></p>
